#showas:狩猎獾
The Hunters are upon you!

You must face a single, extraordinarily powerful AI, midway in difficulty between a 9 and a 10.

This AI has an exceptionally powerful Hunter Fleet, which will also be extremely aggressive.

If that's not enough, a team of Marauders and Sappers are encroaching in the area.

You are joined by some Scourge directly under your command; you'll need to collect resources to build structures for them, but they will provide a lot of extra defensive power. Remember that by building a Scourge Summoner, you can call your scourge Vassals to attack with you.